        <mxCell id="G1" value="&lt;b&gt;MISSING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;Token has no morphological features (tense, person, number). &quot;Conjugate to 2sg preterite&quot; is unspecifiable without them.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="320" width="250" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
